pan.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Glass\" title=\"Glass\">Glass</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Glass\" title=\"Glass\">Glass</a>:</b> Items made of <b>glass</b> are immune to damage from contact with ooze.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Hardness:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Weight:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Base Value:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">4,125 pp\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Location:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Treasure of Crystal Cove</a></b>, Turn in 100 silver <a href=\"/page/Doubloons\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doubloons\">doubloons</a> to <a href=\"/page/Euphonia%27s_Barter_Box\" title=\"Euphonia&#39;s Barter Box\">Euphonia's Barter Box</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Knock\" title=\"Knock\">Knock</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Knock\" title=\"Knock\">Knock</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 10<br /><b>Charges: </b>10</span></span> <b>—</b> 10 Charges</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Dowsing_Rod.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Dowsing_Rod.png/420px-Dowsing_Rod.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"356\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Dowsing_Rod.png 1.5x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">\n<p>Not upgradeable \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><i>A smooth mahogany wand containing multiple charges of Knock.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">The total bonus to the <a href=\"/page/Open_Lock\" title=\"Open Lock\">Open Lock</a> check made with this wand is only +10. This is typically not high enough to open locked doors in level 10 elite quests even on a roll of 20.\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Lesser_Dowsing_Rod_shown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Lesser_Dowsing_Rod_shown.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"130\" height=\"261\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\